Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:12.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：血与沙》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《大难临头》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, ah, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可真是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.96,0:01:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,狂野啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}vigorous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.26,0:01:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点体力活 对你来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like the sort of man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.33,0:01:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎是小意思嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.30,0:01:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喘得厉害呢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am rather rugged…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.13,0:01:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.20,0:01:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸会担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father will be worried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是该担心了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As well he should be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.03,0:01:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.40,0:01:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要走 我会心碎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do, my heart will break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.30,0:01:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,求我留下来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask me to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.76,0:01:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.20,0:01:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,求我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}By my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.43,0:01:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连我叫什么 都不知道吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not even know it, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫Sura\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫Sura\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Sura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.50,0:01:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sura啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字跟你的人一样美\N{\fnArial\fs30}As beautiful as the woman herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.56,0:01:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.63,0:01:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是女人都知道你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every woman knows who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,见你就躲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to avoid you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.30,0:02:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有这么可怕么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bad, am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.60,0:02:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 可怕极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh, the worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为何跟声名狼藉的男人 共度春宵呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why lay with a man of such ill reputation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.50,0:02:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天神让我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods led me to your bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.56,0:02:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,天神？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们显灵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They come to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.00,0:02:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我梦中显灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.33,0:02:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们告诉我 你会成为什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They showed me the man you could become.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.03,0:02:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是走对了路的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If set upon the right path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.16,0:02:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于我的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what else did the gods tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.56,0:02:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,天神都告诉你什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}about my future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.03,0:02:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝不会移情别恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you will never love another woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,心情沉重\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heart weighs heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.33,0:04:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,期盼团圆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much hope in reunion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:04:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不得善终…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To come to such bitter end…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.76,0:05:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fault is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不勒斯的回程路 是出了名的危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}The road from Neapolis is known to be treacherous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.76,0:05:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该派双倍人马护送\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have doubled the guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,三倍才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tripled it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该晚点放Barca自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have delayed giving Barca his freedom{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.73,0:05:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,派他去行使护卫之责\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sent him along as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.03,0:05:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿天神恕罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray the gods forgive my error.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.16,0:05:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你兑现了诺言\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kept your word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.70,0:05:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,错在取她性命之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fault lies with the men who took her life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.93,0:05:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,错在Claudius Glaber\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with Claudius Glaber, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.66,0:05:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他将她判为奴籍\N{\fnArial\fs30}who condemned her to slavery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.53,0:05:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,事已至此\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing to be done{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,回天无力\N{\fnArial\fs30}to change what has passed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须着眼未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must look towards the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是送雨的使者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the Bringer of Rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠灭死亡之影的勇士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Slayer of Death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.93,0:05:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们携手 将斯巴达克斯这名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together we will etch the name Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.16,0:05:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,载入史册\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the pillars of history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是这么叫我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not what she called me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:06:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.60,0:06:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,近一年来 你让我到处找寻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nearly a year you had me searching{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.43,0:06:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个色雷斯女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}for that Thracian woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.83,0:06:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么让我暗地里杀死她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why have me take her life short of the mark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.76,0:06:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得已而为之\N{\fnArial\fs30}An unfortunate necessity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些钱够了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust the sum sufficient?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果还有其它「不得已」\N{\fnArial\fs30}If other "necessities" arise, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万记得找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}consider me your man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.86,0:06:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,花这么多钱把她找回来 却是死人一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So great an expense, to have her delivered all but dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不如告诉斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could just as easily have told Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.03,0:06:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她客死异乡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that she perished abroad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.76,0:06:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是他的命根子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他的心肝宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heart beating beneath his chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以不能这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种男人不会轻易相信她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a man would not believe she was gone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他亲眼看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless his own eyes told him it was so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.20,0:06:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the only course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.53,0:06:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早该告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one which you could have told me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.73,0:06:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were undertaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.86,0:07:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 不会让鲜血玷污\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would keep such blood from these hands, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的玉手\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I have said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手握着你的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hold yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.96,0:07:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道不会间接沾染到么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they not stained by the touch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.26,0:07:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近死了太多的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has been too much death of late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要冒险一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would turn towards more respectable ventures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.36,0:07:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,心无所念的斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}With his wife removed from thought, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,将被我锻造成\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will mold Spartacus into a gladiator{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,史上最伟大的角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}the likes of which the world has never seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.70,0:07:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经战胜了Theokoles\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has already defeated Theokoles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.06,0:07:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看 心无旁骛 只为胜利而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine what he will accomplish once his mind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.66,0:07:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将锐不可当\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been focused on nothing but victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.63,0:07:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你将成为 共和国最富有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be the greatest lanista{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.60,0:07:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,角斗商\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,由此 我们将\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on such a title we will climb{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,声名远播\N{\fnArial\fs30}beyond our station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.23,0:07:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,名扬全国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.33,0:07:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许还能跻身议院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps to the very steps of the Senate itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.30,0:07:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在发烧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fever still grips him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.93,0:08:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果情况好转 记得通知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would know if his condition changes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.50,0:08:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有话跟你说 Doctore\N{\fnArial\fs30}A word, Doctore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pietros 说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pietros.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.50,0:08:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些鸟 Barca房中的那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}The birds, left in Barca's cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该怎么处理它们呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should I do with them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.16,0:08:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.50,0:08:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾说 我们赎身之日\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said we would release them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.73,0:08:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,便是它们自由之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}once he gained our freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.23,0:08:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还打算为你赎身？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He intended yours as well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是为这 他才去和主人谈赎身\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was his purpose in speaking with our Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ashur说 两个人的自由 要价太高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur said the price was too steep for us both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.10,0:08:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ashur说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.53,0:08:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他帮我们说情来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He helped negotiate the sum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.90,0:08:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接着养 行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it be OK if I kept them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说那些鸟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The birds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.56,0:08:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会在意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would not cause notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.66,0:08:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.96,0:09:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is unwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.66,0:09:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果守卫发现你有把匕首…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the guards were to see you with it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已受尽折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could they do to me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还能想出什么新花样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that hasn't already been done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.80,0:09:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该离开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never should have left her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:10:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你离开了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did not leave her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.36,0:10:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是他们抢走了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was taken from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.36,0:10:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我参战前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I left for war, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.23,0:10:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她曾求我留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}she asked me not to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你参战也是为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did what you thought was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.60,0:10:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}To protect her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.10,0:10:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁早把这匕首扔下悬崖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should toss that over the cliff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.70,0:10:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别干傻事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best to be done with such thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 这东西比你还值钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful with that. It costs more than your worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.66,0:10:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,家族复兴 指日可待了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't be long until our house is finally livable again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.53,0:10:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼光放长远些！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tilt your bow higher!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们意在天下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We aim at the heavens!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,建造Batiaus皇宫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Palace of Batiatus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让达官显贵趋之若鹜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where dignitaries kneel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.36,0:10:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为一窥我的财富！\N{\fnArial\fs30}to suck the cock of my good fortune!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.30,0:10:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 他们可得排队…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they'll have to get in line…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.23,0:10:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.70,0:11:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺着别动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lie still!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.26,0:11:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好遵医嘱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best to heed the advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.56,0:11:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一度以为你必死无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a while we thought you for the afterlife, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我何时能再战？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When will I fight again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.06,0:11:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他问 何时能再战\N{\fnArial\fs30}When will I fight again he says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只管好生养病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worry of nothing but recovery, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.43,0:11:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有朝一日 民众会再度为你癫狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}the crowd will once again cheer the name Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来说句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}A word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be improper for me to visit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.80,0:11:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,去训练场看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}you in the ludus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.93,0:11:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的心时刻牵挂着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But know that my thoughts are with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.20,0:11:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会吩咐女仆Naevia 帮忙打点你的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll send my slave Naevia often to attend your needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.33,0:11:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也不要担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and worry for nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的练习剑 战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your swords for practice, Champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day's training begins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.30,0:12:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,捉对厮杀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pair up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,换剑和盾来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sword and shield!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.60,0:12:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.43,0:12:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我对阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You face me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.16,0:12:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子过世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife's passing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.23,0:12:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感到非常遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was an unfortunate thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.63,0:12:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你夭折的逃跑计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}As was your plan for escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.63,0:12:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然 我多年滴酒未沾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not tasted wine for many years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.66,0:13:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还不至于被一杯酒灌醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet a single cup would not rob me of my senses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想让你睡着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The choice was to see you sleep…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.93,0:13:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,或不再醒来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or never awaken?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的企图未被察觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your victory over Theokoles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.50,0:13:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是因为Batiatus还沉浸于\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the only reason Batiatus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.76,0:13:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你屠灭Theokoles的胜利之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}does not know of your treachery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.63,0:13:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则战神的身份 也救不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Champion or no, you would be crucified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就省省口舌 等着看吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then part your lips and see it done!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.26,0:13:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次再想逃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time you seek escape…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好先杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd best kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一半就好 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it half, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:13:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mercato啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Mercato!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.13,0:14:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,乱糟糟的 你别介意啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must excuse the chaos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,本想在你来以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had hoped to see such affairs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,把事情完工的\N{\fnArial\fs30}completed before your arrival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.23,0:14:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,财运亨通啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortune favors you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.56,0:14:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从卡普亚喜降甘霖后 人人如此！\N{\fnArial\fs30}As it does all of Capua, since the rains!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我时间紧迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}My time is pressed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.66,0:14:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我们切入正题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, let us to business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.93,0:14:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 谈正事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, to the matter then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.23,0:14:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为彰显我家族的荣耀 我要举办竞技赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I secured six of your men for my games, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.76,0:14:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,并已和你敲定你手下六人参赛的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}honoring the storied history of my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你还记得的话 这一切均已于火神节前安排妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrangements made before the Vulcanalia, if you recall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,恍然如昨啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if it were yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.56,0:14:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我已决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've decided as highlight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.06,0:14:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要重现罗马大胜梅迪的辉煌战史\N{\fnArial\fs30}to reenact Rome's victory over the Maedi, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.53,0:14:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么个色雷斯蛮族部落 竟然胆敢侵犯马其顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Thracian tribe who dared invade Macedonia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.33,0:14:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们如此傲慢无礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were slaughtered for their insolence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.50,0:14:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,早已被我祖父\N{\fnArial\fs30}by my grandfather, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.00,0:14:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Marcus Minucius Rufus屠戮殆尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus Minucius Rufus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的确声名显赫 万古流芳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A name that carries weight, long after it's passing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.63,0:14:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算重现他的辉煌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd planned for to play the very man himself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,横扫千军\N{\fnArial\fs30}leading the charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.73,0:14:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus尚未从Theokoles一战中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus is yet recovering{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.90,0:14:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,恢复元气\N{\fnArial\fs30}from his battle with Theokoles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不出所料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. As I suspected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,换Gnaeus怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps Gnaeus, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒倾向于 派斯巴达克斯出场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turn thought towards Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的身价可不一般呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is much in demand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.60,0:14:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,要多少钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cost of such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.90,0:14:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,再多加40%\N{\fnArial\fs30}An additional forty percent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.43,0:14:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括派犯人去扮演色雷斯人的角色？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prisoners to play the Thracians included?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:14:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,包在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:15:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让卡普亚城人尽皆知！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will see it announced all over Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.56,0:15:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 「死亡之影」的屠灭者！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus, Slayer of Theokoles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.10,0:15:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,演绎我祖父的辉煌！\N{\fnArial\fs30}To assume the mantle of my grandfather!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的一天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.13,0:15:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pietros啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pietros.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.10,0:15:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,多拿点水来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring more water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.86,0:15:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking pig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他把爪子搭在人家身上那邪样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way he paws at the boy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.26,0:15:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都怪Barca\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fault lies with Barca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,舍他而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}For leaving him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,送出了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it delivered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.23,0:15:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}As promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是给我妻子的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}A letter to my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.23,0:15:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真难得啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long overdue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.30,0:15:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.70,0:15:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有她的回信吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you bring reply?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.86,0:15:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不要我转达\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did not favor me with one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持亲自答复\N{\fnArial\fs30}She insisted on bringing you message herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.43,0:16:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么进来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you gain entry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人Ashur代我向Batiatus乞求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your man Ashur spoke to Batiatus on my behalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.73,0:16:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为此问你要钱了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he ask coin for the service?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.90,0:16:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他会找你商量\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he would take the matter up with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.80,0:16:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现下谁还在意钱财 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares of coin on such a day, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.83,0:16:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子长这么大了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy has grown monstrous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.23,0:16:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的母亲也愈发美丽了啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his mother ever more beautiful…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.70,0:16:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想念你唇齿间的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss the taste of your lips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.33,0:17:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那封信令我深感意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}The letter came as a surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.80,0:17:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每日祈求获知 有关你的些许消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day I prayed for word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.90,0:17:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈祷消息传来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that it would not be news{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是关于你战死竞技场\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your death in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.83,0:17:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说过不通信的 Aurelia\N{\fnArial\fs30}We agreed no letters, Aurelia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了使你和孩子远离血海\N{\fnArial\fs30}To keep you and the boy far from this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.76,0:17:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要忧心我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my mind on the task.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.60,0:17:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么使你有所改变呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what has changed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.80,0:17:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.70,0:17:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他所失去的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}His loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你因一个朋友而改变主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are moved by a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.26,0:17:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我因想见妻子的渴望 而改变主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am moved by the need to see my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.46,0:17:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了确信她真实可寻\N{\fnArial\fs30}To know she is still real, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非痴人说梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not the dream of a desperate man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.63,0:17:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过一年多 我的债务即可还清\N{\fnArial\fs30}After one more year my debts will be paid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们便可重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can start again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.13,0:17:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家团聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us, together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.43,0:17:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have just left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.86,0:17:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,去庞贝城 或西西里岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Pompeii. Or Sicilia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做有损荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would not have been honorable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣耀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.03,0:17:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你欠下巨额赌债 又无力偿还时 荣耀何在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the honor in debts of gambling and chance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.43,0:17:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你抛离妻儿时 荣耀何在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the honor in leaving your wife and child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.16,0:18:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所犯下的每一个错误…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every mistake I have made…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都会尽力矫正\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will set right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会成为配得上你的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be the man you deserve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.40,0:18:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,自此刻起 我的命便是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From this moment on my life is yours, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯你专属\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yours alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.86,0:18:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am with child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.13,0:18:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀上了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.13,0:18:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your meaning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.63,0:18:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Varro啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varro…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.73,0:18:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.76,0:18:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,自你走后 生活困苦不堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your absence has been difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.26,0:18:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给的钱仅够\N{\fnArial\fs30}The money you send barely enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.43,0:18:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,勉强糊口\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep us fed and sheltered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Titus提供了帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Titus offered assistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Titus是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Titus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.83,0:18:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,集市上认识的熟人\N{\fnArial\fs30}An acquaintance, from the marketplace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为了回报他的施舍 就把身子给卖了？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you repay him by spreading your fucking legs?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.10,0:18:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的 我本来仅仅将他视作朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I thought of him only as a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.56,0:18:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他强行占取我的身子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He forced himself upon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不阻止他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you stop him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.26,0:18:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我想这样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I wanted this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.90,0:18:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被人肆意糟践时 你在哪儿 Varro？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you, Varro?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时你在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the fuck were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.86,0:19:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在拼命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.13,0:19:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我们而拼命\N{\fnArial\fs30}For us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你本该做到的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you should have been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus家族 旗下勇士无数\N{\fnArial\fs30}The House of Batiatus is filled with champions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.06,0:19:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.93,0:19:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祖父亦如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandfather's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久你也会成为他们中的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon you will stand among them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.33,0:19:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让你名垂青史\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have commissioned you to be immortalized in stone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕不惜一切代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}at great expense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.06,0:19:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很荣幸 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You honor me, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.43,0:19:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣誉将不再只属于他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well the laurels do not cease there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.30,0:19:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mercato坚持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Mercato has insisted that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.23,0:19:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,让斯巴达克斯在他的比赛里当前锋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus be moved to the forefront of his games!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将扮演他传说中的祖父\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will take the guise of his storied grandfather, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.40,0:19:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,即Marcus Minucius Rufus！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus Minucius Rufus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.13,0:19:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rufus吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.26,0:19:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know of him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.93,0:19:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说过这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have heard the name, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,小时候听父亲提到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}spoken by my father when I was a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.30,0:19:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将会穿上他的战袍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be dressed in his very armor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:20:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有四个角斗士将扮成罗马军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}four of our gladiators bedecked as Roman Legion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.33,0:20:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们的敌人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our enemy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.43,0:20:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个死囚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six prisoners sentenced to execution, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,将打扮成色雷斯梅迪部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}clad in the barbaric fashion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.26,0:20:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,典型的野蛮人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Thracian hordes of the Maedi!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.36,0:20:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你驾驭全场\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be a grand spectacle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.13,0:20:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那场面该多么恢弘壮阔啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}with you its shining helm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.80,0:20:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会上场的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.03,0:20:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你误会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You misunderstand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.33,0:20:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在请示你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.90,0:20:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在命令你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.46,0:20:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会打扮成一个罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not dress as a Roman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.66,0:20:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,并假装屠杀我的同胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}and pretend to slaughter my own people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.13,0:20:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候放开你那执着的过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is time for you to release your hold upon past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.06,0:20:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不再是色雷斯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are no longer of Thrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.20,0:20:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你命中注定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are destined for great{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.26,0:20:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要成就一番大业 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wonderful things, Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.96,0:20:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受天神赐予你的成功之路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Embrace the path the gods have set you upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的心被太多的悲痛所蒙蔽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mind is clouded by grief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.20,0:20:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好想清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pause to clear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.06,0:20:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就像在给孩子擦洗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bathe me as if a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:21:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.63,0:21:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺好别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lay still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.10,0:21:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会让伤口裂开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll reopen your wounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.00,0:21:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至都起不了身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't even rise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.23,0:21:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟早会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.96,0:21:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤痛总是角斗士的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always the enemy of a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.16,0:21:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在对我们来说却是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet friend to us now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人给了我们在一起的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domina has given excuse for us to be together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.86,0:21:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们从不幸中获得了一丝幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us pluck blessing from misfortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.53,0:21:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus 你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus, you live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的祷告应验了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My prayers, answered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.66,0:21:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该多祷告一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have more prayers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.00,0:21:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我能够重回沙场\N{\fnArial\fs30}to return me to the sand to be by the men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.83,0:21:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快 你就可以回到你的兄弟们中间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shall rejoin your brothers soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brothers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.40,0:21:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有一个人来看过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}None have visited me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.26,0:21:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是Barca\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even Barca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.26,0:21:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有告诉他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you not told him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.66,0:21:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直没有合适的时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}The moment has not arisen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.13,0:21:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在竞技场倒下了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has he fallen, in the arena?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.63,0:21:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far the opposite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.43,0:21:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他赎回了他的自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has purchased his freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.66,0:22:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个迦太基野兽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Beast of Carthage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.30,0:22:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果Barca不做角斗士 他又能做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is Barca if not a gladiator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.36,0:22:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,人 自由漫步于这些高墙外的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man. Free to roam outside these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.20,0:22:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这想法真奇特\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thought is foreign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.26,0:22:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个巨人去牧羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The giant fuck tending goats{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.66,0:22:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后自己采摘蔬菜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and picking vegetables?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.63,0:22:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,与他宠爱的老婆Pietros在一起？\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Pietros his ever doting wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.80,0:22:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没带那孩子走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.70,0:22:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他迟早要和他的命根分家！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd sooner part with his own cock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.33,0:22:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个消息也让我很吃惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The news found me surprised also.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.46,0:22:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不想这样 但是别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did not wish it, but had no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.23,0:22:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他谈过？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shared words with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.06,0:22:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 但是我从他的眼里看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I saw it in his eyes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.83,0:22:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他被人送出大门的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}as he was escorted through the gates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.86,0:22:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时你在场？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.20,0:22:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好恢复体力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regain your strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.40,0:22:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望很快看见你手持利剑 重返训练场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would see you with a sword in hand soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.76,0:23:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Barca走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barca gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.13,0:23:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯成了战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.93,0:23:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我醒来后的世界已面目全非\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have awoken to a world of shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.36,0:23:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拒绝Batiatus可真傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a fool to refuse Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.96,0:23:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他提出了很多不合理的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man makes unreasonable demands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.26,0:23:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is your master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.83,0:23:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管合理与否 他的命令就是你的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}His demands your duty, unreasonable or otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.60,0:23:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会受迫去屠杀我的同胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not be forced to slaughter my countrymen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.66,0:23:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过衣服相同而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Countrymen in dress only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.90,0:23:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和这些囚犯没有任何血缘关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You share no kinship with these prisoners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.83,0:23:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are murderers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.83,0:23:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,强奸犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rapists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.13,0:23:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their death well deserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 让另一个人去手刃他们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let another man's blade grant it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.80,0:23:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你表现得 就像你在这件事上有选择权似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You act as if you have free will in the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.20,0:23:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是一个角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.46,0:23:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是一个特雷斯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a Thracian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.93,0:23:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是一个奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.06,0:23:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,越过这道高墙的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}To cling to a life beyond these walls{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.76,0:23:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是看着自己肝脑涂地\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to see your heart parted from your chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.33,0:23:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比任何人都清楚这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You above all others should know this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.36,0:24:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说话不经过考虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not think before I speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.60,0:24:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去找一个让我省心的同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will remove myself to less deserving company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.70,0:24:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pietros 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pietros…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.93,0:24:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Gnaeus干的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gnaeus's hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.93,0:24:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall have a word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.06,0:24:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,又能怎么样呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.93,0:24:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,能换回Barca吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will it see Barca return?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.46,0:24:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,能换回我俩的重聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will it see us reunited, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.23,0:24:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是主人承诺的自由？\N{\fnArial\fs30}or free, as he promised?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.20,0:24:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运的强大 往往让人无可奈何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fate often takes a man far from his heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.13,0:24:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让他后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}To his regret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.46,0:24:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下我一个人 在这思念心痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felt more keenly by the one left behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.46,0:25:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马人得知Theokoles\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rome is positively aflutter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.73,0:25:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,战败的消息后 肯定震惊不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}with news of Theokoles' defeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.86,0:25:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人接受得了 这样的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one could believe such a thing was possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.66,0:25:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是死在一个色雷斯人手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially at the hands of a Thracian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.26,0:25:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,神明真是眷恋Batiatus家啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods truly bless the House of Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.96,0:25:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还打算和赞助人一起欢聚娱乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've even entertaining thoughts of a patron{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.00,0:25:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来分享下我们的好运呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}to share in our good fortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.66,0:25:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.80,0:25:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的好运 有没有往下延伸呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And does your good fortune extend downward?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.70,0:25:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.60,0:25:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,女祭司啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Priestess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.06,0:25:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,生育仪式之后 你的肚子有动静了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has her fertility rite born any seed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.20,0:25:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没能在限期之内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was unable to conclude the rite{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.86,0:25:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,与人结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the allotted time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.30,0:25:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.30,0:25:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜 我丈夫不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well my husband was sadly absent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.86,0:25:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外那个人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of the other man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.46,0:25:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你还是没跟我讲 关于他的事情呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. You still have not told me anything about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.96,0:25:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Solonius吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it Solonius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.40,0:25:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁可跟条鳗鱼交媾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would rather fuck an eel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.93,0:25:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 像你这么漂亮的女人 还是配得上一个男人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, a woman as beautiful as you are deserves a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.30,0:25:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是哪个位高权重的人…？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone of position maybe…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.86,0:25:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个普普通通的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's no one of note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.10,0:25:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,普普通通的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one of note…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.36,0:25:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是身体很强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone more physical, perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.60,0:26:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是奴隶吗？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A slave?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.60,0:26:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你的杯子空了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, your cups empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.13,0:26:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.76,0:26:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能随便找个奴隶 太不合你身份了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not just any slave, no not for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.40,0:26:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得是天神亲自锻造出来的才行…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would have to be forged by Jupiter himself…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.26,0:26:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们换个话题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us move on from the subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.86,0:26:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 换个话题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. To other matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.46,0:26:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How fares Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.06,0:26:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.50,0:26:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,和Theokoles大战之后 他伤势如何啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}His injuries, suffered against Theokoles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.13,0:26:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还能活过来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he expected to live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.10,0:26:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,体力算是恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His strength returns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.80,0:26:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joyous news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.80,0:26:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此猛男就这样死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be a great tragedy to see such a man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.60,0:26:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,岂不是太悲剧了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}pass from this world, would it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.80,0:26:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.43,0:26:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只可惜他不能参加Mercato的竞技了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pity he will not take the sand in good Mercato's games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.80,0:26:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想看他挥剑斩人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I long to see his sword thrust home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.50,0:26:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you fare?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.96,0:26:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是上次比赛的赌注\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game of dice and bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.00,0:27:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 跟我往常一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poorly, as I often have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.63,0:27:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次 我会补回损失的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will balance the loss at next chance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.30,0:27:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pietros好像不管他的鸟群了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would seem Pietros has lost control of his flock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.06,0:27:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pietros啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pietros…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.50,0:27:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻孩子 自尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy has freed himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.13,0:27:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gnaeus 我操你妈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gnaeus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.43,0:28:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.26,0:28:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this foolishness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.53,0:28:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了Pietros\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pietros.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.13,0:28:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy took his own life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.56,0:28:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be missed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.96,0:28:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也尝不到我的阳物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially his lips around my cock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.06,0:29:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早我还鼓吹说 我有全卡普亚最好的持网和三叉戟角斗士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This morning I boasted the top Retiarius in all of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.90,0:29:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我却只剩乱石堆上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I possess nothing more than bones{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.30,0:29:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,断骨和迸溅的脑浆了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and brains scattered upon the rocks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.76,0:29:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.96,0:29:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的对不起！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck your apologies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.60,0:29:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去的财富 我会全部收回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have return of the value lost!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.56,0:29:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,死去角斗士的身价 要从你的奖金中扣\N{\fnArial\fs30}The price of the man will be subtracted from your winnings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.66,0:29:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到补足为止！\N{\fnArial\fs30}until the remainder is balanced!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.40,0:29:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,随您心意 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you see fit, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.20,0:29:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是为了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of this for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.36,0:29:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pietros吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pietros?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.46,0:29:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他算个鸟 贱货的杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was nothing. Shit from a whore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.03,0:29:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个人 他的性命也有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a man. His life had worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.46,0:29:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,最多值半毛钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half a coin at most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.00,0:29:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gnaeus可是个角斗士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gnaeus was a gladiator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.26,0:29:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,成年累月的训练 每次提高都付出了昂贵的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years of training, each mounting to exorbitant cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.13,0:29:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才叫价值！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is true worth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.83,0:29:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不配活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did not deserve to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.70,0:29:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我才能决定生死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I alone decides who live!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.60,0:29:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你！你这该死的奴隶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you! Not a fucking slave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.53,0:29:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.63,0:29:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经够宽宏大量了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My generosity has been boundless, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.53,0:29:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你 直到现在还不服从我\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet you defy me still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.30,0:30:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mercato的竞技赛就要到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mercato's games are upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.73,0:30:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能作为一个忠诚的罗马人去战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect you to fight as a loyal Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.66,0:30:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 做个色雷斯人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or die as a Thracian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.76,0:30:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他去看医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}See him to the Medicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.23,0:30:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为这个孩子落泪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shed tears for the boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.90,0:30:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的死让我心痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}His passing saddens me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.30,0:30:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这种弱者不适合这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was too weak for this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.96,0:30:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其在没有Barca保护他时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without Barca to protect him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.76,0:30:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非每个人都是强者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of us can be strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.46,0:31:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有言归于好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been making friends again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.10,0:31:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gnaeus啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gnaeus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.30,0:31:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不干\N{\fnArial\fs30}A disagreement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.70,0:31:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就为不值一提的Pietros当出头鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you emerged the battered cunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.33,0:31:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧 难道你还斗不过Gnaeus的小网么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, did his tiny net prove too fierce an opponent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.10,0:31:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可是杀死死亡之影的英雄啊？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the slayer of Theokoles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.20,0:31:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去问他自己好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask the man himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.16,0:31:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要到悬崖下面去问他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can scrape enough of him off the cliff for reply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.96,0:31:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gnaeus死了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gnaeus is dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.63,0:31:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要杀死他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What reason did you have to take his life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.00,0:31:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,无可奉告\N{\fnArial\fs30}My reasoning lies forever silent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.73,0:31:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的行为背叛了我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your actions betray us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.53,0:31:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gnaeus是一位角头士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gnaeus was a gladiator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.50,0:31:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}A brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.50,0:31:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是我的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was no brother of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.10,0:31:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你宣誓之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you swore the oath, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.23,0:31:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的所有人 都变成你的兄弟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}every man in here became your brother, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.63,0:31:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得你为他们 在竞技场上光荣地死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}deservide of an honorable death in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.36,0:31:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的行为亵渎了我们曾经的并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your actions shame my fighting beside you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.30,0:31:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得好像你在这里有权选择似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak as if you had choice in the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.90,0:31:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有 当时在角斗场上 我就选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did and I chose not to end your life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.66,0:31:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你活了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.86,0:31:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我现在真有些后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}A decision I presently regret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.40,0:32:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有些后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}As do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.93,0:32:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很了解Pietros？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew Pietros well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.86,0:32:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是路过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only in passing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.00,0:32:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你在照料他的宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you tend to his pets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.93,0:32:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是自觉自愿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A duty not required.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.10,0:32:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这人就这傻样\N{\fnArial\fs30}A foolish gesture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.93,0:32:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你天性善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born of a kind heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.06,0:32:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些吃惊 Barca赎得自由后\N{\fnArial\fs30}It surprises, that Barca would claim his freedom{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.23,0:32:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,会抛弃心爱的人 独自离去\N{\fnArial\fs30}at yet leave the things he loved in captivity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.16,0:32:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是否跟你提起过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he speak to you of his plans{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.30,0:32:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他离开训练场后的打算？\N{\fnArial\fs30}for life outside the Ludus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.86,0:32:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.06,0:32:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟Ashur吵过架吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he exchange words with Ashur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.53,0:32:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说Ashur？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.93,0:32:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时他有没有在场？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was there, was he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.80,0:32:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想不起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not recall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.26,0:33:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说 如果你认真想想的话 肯定记得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely if you set your mind to the task…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.10,0:33:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我该回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, but I must return to the villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.33,0:33:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人在等我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domina awaits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.20,0:33:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼神有些慌乱 说明你在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fear in your eyes betray the lie on your tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.20,0:33:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的问题会害死我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your questions put me in harm's way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.36,0:33:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳驾 让一下路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Let me pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.76,0:33:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间过得真快呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day approaches{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.43,0:33:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于可以摆脱这玩意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I'm finally free of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.43,0:33:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你可以把它改成不错的阳物啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you can fashion a proper cock from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.93,0:33:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,都走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.26,0:33:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.03,0:33:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seek information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.33,0:33:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}On what subject?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.36,0:33:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于Barca的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.73,0:33:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他在Theokoles之战中下了赌注\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand he made wager upon the Theokoles fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.93,0:33:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 还赢了一笔巨款\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and won a small fortune, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.43,0:34:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,并用来赎回了自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}applied towards his freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.93,0:34:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么不带Pietros一起走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}With no thought towards Pietros?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.76,0:34:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱不够赎回两个人的自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough coin remained to liberate him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.70,0:34:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Barca当时眼泪汪汪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barca's eyes filled with tears, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.06,0:34:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管有些悔恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}though spurred by regret{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.43,0:34:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是为自由动心了 我想是这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}or impending freedom, I know not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.63,0:34:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到奴役的枷锁被去掉 他很激动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a stirring sight to see the bonds of servitude lifted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.90,0:34:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.63,0:34:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着Barca离开别墅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I confess my eyes swimming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.80,0:34:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的眼睛也湿润了\N{\fnArial\fs30}as Barca took leave of the villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.90,0:34:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁看到Barca离开？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else offered farewells?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.36,0:34:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 只有主人和我两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, only our master and myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.60,0:34:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Naevia说 是她陪Barca走到门口的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia claims to have escorted Barca to the gates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.03,0:34:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没说你也在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made no mention of your presents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.06,0:34:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 她那么天真 很容易…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, she's a simple thing, her mind easily…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.23,0:34:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些矛盾的说法让我怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stories in conflict give me concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.96,0:34:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I find there is more to the matter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.50,0:34:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Barca的离去有问题…\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Barca's departure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.20,0:34:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还会来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we shall have words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.50,0:35:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还信仰他们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still believe in them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.26,0:35:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,信仰神？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.50,0:35:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.40,0:35:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.30,0:35:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们整个村都被毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our entire village is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.43,0:35:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认识的人也都被杀害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone we knew, dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.50,0:35:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有神佑…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there are no gods…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.00,0:35:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就不可能活在世上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is nothing to shape what happens in our lives…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.26,0:35:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会失去意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no meaning to any of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.03,0:36:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有神佑 我们怎会走到一起…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot believe the gods would lead me to you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.20,0:36:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又怎会得到你如此的疼爱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bless me with such love…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.46,0:36:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,却无法为你分担痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}only to make me bare witness to your suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.30,0:36:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都是神佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.73,0:36:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要走的道路 神早就给你设计好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a deeper purpose to the path you've been set upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.83,0:36:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过你现在还没有发现这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that has yet to reveal itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.03,0:36:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不会让你离开我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never see you from my side again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.60,0:36:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你 我就没有了活着的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without you, there is no reason for breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.96,0:36:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,活着的理由永远存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is always reason to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.16,0:36:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可能会找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would be lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.76,0:36:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.30,0:36:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,神会指引你走上正确的道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods would set you on the proper path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.46,0:36:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需闭上眼睛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do is close your eyes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.50,0:36:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把自己交到神的手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and place yourself in their hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.36,0:37:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We leave for the games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.20,0:37:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is your decision made?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.13,0:37:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,想好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.23,0:37:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算是什么答案？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What sort of answer is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.16,0:37:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,礼节而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gesture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.46,0:37:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎给我这个有何意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}I care not for its means of delivery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.93,0:37:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使那意味着乐意服从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps its meaning will be more agreeable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.06,0:37:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就说说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out with it, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.03,0:37:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sura经常和我说起神明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sura spoke often to me of the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.36,0:37:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她相信神明\N{\fnArial\fs30}She believed in them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.40,0:37:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我却从不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never truly have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.73,0:37:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你算什么 居然敢质疑神明！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cock on you, daring to doubt the gods!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.70,0:37:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经受够痛苦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have suffered much for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.46,0:37:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.16,0:37:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始…\N{\fnArial\fs30}From this point forward…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.16,0:37:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把自己奉献给她的信仰…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give myself over to her beliefs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.23,0:38:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受我的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}and embrace my fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.93,0:38:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的话 让我非常喜悦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your words give my heart great joy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.43,0:38:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至让我不再想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough even to erase questions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.90,0:38:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么行政官儿子的剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}of how a blade belonging to the Magistrate's son{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.20,0:38:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,会在你手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}came to your possession.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.70,0:38:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们抛却过往吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us put the past truly behind us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.63,0:38:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 比赛在等着你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come the games await you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.96,0:38:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有一个条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have but one condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.86,0:38:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,条件？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Condition?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.16,0:38:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拍我马屁 就是为了跟我提要求？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kiss my cheek only to finger my ass?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.66,0:38:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃！说！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh! Speak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.93,0:38:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我割掉你该死的舌头前 快讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I carve out your fucking tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.00,0:38:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会倾尽全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take to the sands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.16,0:38:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,去对抗我自己的同胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}against the spectre of my countrymen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.36,0:38:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要独自一人面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will face them alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.10,0:38:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个对你一个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six to your one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.16,0:38:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让卡普亚的战神为这样的谬论冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not risk the Champion of Capua to such absurdity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.66,0:38:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是我的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is my fate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.30,0:38:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这确实就是神明\N{\fnArial\fs30}if this is the path the gods{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.70,0:38:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我安排的路…\N{\fnArial\fs30}have truly set me upon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.20,0:38:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们就不会让我失败的\N{\fnArial\fs30}then they will not see me fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.56,0:39:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是错的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you are wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.26,0:39:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我会在与妻子重聚之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I will give your city{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.36,0:39:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你呈现一场精彩的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}a great spectacle of blood…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.63,0:39:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,血光盛宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}before joining my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.56,0:39:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,神明已经帮你走了这么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods have brought you this far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.56,0:39:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信这还远未结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe they are not done with you yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.40,0:39:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我也有一个条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have a condition of my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.96,0:39:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你杀掉所有那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you have killed the last of these shits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.16,0:39:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,假装成你同胞的人时\N{\fnArial\fs30}garbed as your countrymen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.93,0:39:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你体内残存的色雷斯人性 就会和他们一起灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's left of the Thracian inside you dies with them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.66,0:39:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要接受命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will embrace this fate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.53,0:39:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,去做命定的斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your destiny as Spartacus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.30,0:39:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,去做卡普亚的战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Champion of Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.00,0:40:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚的市民们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Citizens of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.66,0:40:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 我们很荣幸地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, we honor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.90,0:40:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,请到了尊贵的Marcus Minucius Rufus\N{\fnArial\fs30}the noble Marcus Minucius Rufus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.66,0:40:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马执政官和无比荣耀的指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Roman consul and commander unmatched in glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.46,0:40:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为贺礼 Mercato将再现\N{\fnArial\fs30}As tribute, good Mercato has seen fit to re-enact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.40,0:40:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他祖父最著名的\N{\fnArial\fs30}his grandfather's most famous victory{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.03,0:40:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,击败色雷斯部落之战！\N{\fnArial\fs30}against the Thracian hordes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.03,0:41:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看站在你们面前的囚徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gaze at the prisoners standing before you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.13,0:41:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象一下色雷斯人梅迪部落 入侵马其顿省的情景\N{\fnArial\fs30}And imagine the Thracian Maedi that invaded Macedonia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.03,0:41:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,抢劫 掠夺我们高贵的人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rape, pillaging its noble people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.60,0:41:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀掉了所有的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murdering all in their path…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.06,0:41:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至还杀了罗马地方官！\N{\fnArial\fs30}even a Roman governor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.03,0:41:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴行和疯狂弥漫着整块大地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violence and madness swept the land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.84,0:41:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,仰望天庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Echoing into the heavens, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.59,0:41:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的天神也不忍相看\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the gods themselves turned their backs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.14,0:41:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎都迷失了 直到罗马人派出他所眷顾的宠子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All seemed lost, until Rome dispatched it's favored son…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.57,0:41:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Marcus Minucius Rufus进场！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enter Marcus Minucius Rufus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.26,0:41:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要扮演可敬的Rufus\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the honorable role of Rufus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.66,0:41:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was but one choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.66,0:41:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,送雨的使者！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bringer of Rain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.06,0:41:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠灭死亡之影的勇士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Slayer of Theokoles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.03,0:41:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚的战神…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Champion of Capua…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.50,0:42:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.10,0:42:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将其送给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I present to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.63,0:42:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.73,0:42:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.46,0:42:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.60,0:42:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.73,0:42:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.16,0:42:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为我们尊敬的是你祖父\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was your grandfather we honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.40,0:42:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来人们赞誉的是「斯巴达克斯」啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet the crowd chants "Spartacus".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.56,0:42:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要为小事伤神 Mercato\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worry not of details, good Mercato.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.00,0:42:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣耀是你祖父一个人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The glory is your grandfather's alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.10,0:42:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.80,0:42:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,发信号 让光荣的胜利之战开始吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give the signal to begin the glorious victory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.73,0:42:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为表达对Marcus Minucius Rufus的敬意…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In honor of Marcus Minucius Rufus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.30,0:42:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让血流成河吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let blood be shed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.33,0:43:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所需要做的就是 闭上眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do is close your eyes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.86,0:43:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,把自己交到神明手中…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and place yourself in their hands…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.13,0:44:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.90,0:45:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真认为 我祖父赢了此次战争吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do realize my grandfather won this battle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.46,0:45:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许今天 历史不会重现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps this day history will not repeat itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.56,0:45:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有活下去的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is always a reason to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.06,0:45:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,神明会安排你走上正确的道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods would set you on the proper path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.50,0:45:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}YEAH!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.36,0:46:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他战斗起来像着魔了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fights like a man possessed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.96,0:46:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,被天神附体了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the gods themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.00,0:46:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.83,0:46:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.86,0:46:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.60,0:47:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.80,0:47:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.16,0:47:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.80,0:47:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.16,0:48:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,精彩的表演！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A marvelous show!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.60,0:48:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸为您服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}An honor to be of service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.76,0:48:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.63,0:48:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.83,0:48:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.40,0:48:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.63,0:48:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}AM…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.63,0:48:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.30,0:48:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.03,0:48:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
